# ============================================================
# Magnet Frame PRO — git ignore (WHITELIST mode)
# ============================================================
# Strategy: ignore EVERYTHING in the repo root, then explicitly
# allow only the files Railway needs:
#   - server/  (FastAPI app)
#   - site/    (marketing + checkout HTML)
#   - DEPLOY.md
#   - .gitignore (this file)
#   - אתר רכישה.bat / אתר ניהול.bat (local launchers)
#
# Everything else (PyQt5 desktop app, assets, archive, etc.)
# stays out of the repo.
# ============================================================

# --- Step 1: ignore everything in root by default ---
/*

# --- Step 2: allow the web stack ---
!/.gitignore
!/DEPLOY.md
!/server/
!/site/
!/אתר רכישה.bat
!/אתר ניהול.bat

# --- Step 3: inside server/, still skip sensitive files ---
server/.env
server/.env.local
server/.env.production
server/licenses.db
server/licenses.db-shm
server/licenses.db-wal
server/data/*.db
server/data/*.db-*
server/__pycache__/
server/**/__pycache__/
server/**/*.pyc
server/**/*.pyo

# --- Step 4: inside site/, skip legacy + build artefacts ---
site/index.legacy.html
site/_build/
site/magnet-frame-pro-SITE.html
site/_logo.txt
